<title>POLAND: NBP SELLS PLN 200 MLN OF 273-DAY NBP-BILLS.</title>
<headline>NBP SELLS PLN 200 MLN OF 273-DAY NBP-BILLS.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Poland sold 200 million zlotys of its 273-day NBP-bills, the amount on offer, after Polish banks bid for 367 million zlotys of the bills, the central bank said.</p>
<p>The average yield was 19.91 percent, down from 19.95 percent at the last auction on October 18.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 2 653 9700</p>
